subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T04:27:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T06:59:48Z","body":"@YeldhamDev also I have realised the MRP layout is for some reason different on `godot 4.7.2`, `master` and of course `pr` for `pr` I can understand but why is it different between those two and which one should be considered correct as the original issue was reported in v4.7.2.stable.official:\n\r\n|PR|`master`|`4.7.2`|\r\n|-|-|-|\r\n|<img width=\"779\" height=\"454\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-04 094013\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e198a164-ffc8-4418-9236-e4a03cdcbcb9\" />|<img width=\"722\" height=\"441\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-04 090854\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03d48da0-4bd6-436a-8b5a-770a043985f3\" />|<img width=\"714\" height=\"461\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-04 095546\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b1f75f3-7dc9-48f2-a977-14a414993f2a\" />|","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5535653415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542276348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5542276348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5542276348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSlhs_A","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T14:55:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:55:26Z","body":"I would assume the `master` one, but just to be sure: CC @StarryWorm.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542276348/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5543610144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5543610144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5543610144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSmzHIA","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T16:38:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T16:53:45Z","body":"Forgot to check the MRP after reviewing the code; thanks, Yeldham, for catching the regression. As you correctly assumed, the layout on `master` is more correct. \r\nThe difference is quite interesting, as somehow it looks like the Labels are splitting the available space in the PR build in the BoxContainer, which could be considered more correct. Although it isn't wrapping them correctly, as if they had 640 width available instead of the 318 they have... If the splitting behavior stays after fixing the other issue, and the wrapping behavior is fixed, we'll need to discuss it, but I would almost go as far as to call it a desirable side effect. \r\nSomething like this: \r\n<img width=\"536\" height=\"410\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dced6bb-21d2-4d00-95f9-377ce4592539\" />\r\nThis is how it should work, as described in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120640: \"From the remaining space, distribute to children with a desired size greater than their minimum size based on the ratio of their desired sizes (i.e. a child who desires twice as much space as another will get twice as much, regardless of how much they end up getting).\" <sub> The left Label should get ~4/7th of the space and the right one ~3/7th, but I don't think that's enough for two columns for the left one, hence 1 column and \"even\" splitting. </sub>\r\nLooks like a regression slipped in with some PR... I really need to add unit tests. \r\n\r\nThe problem with the ultra-wide `PanelContainer`, though, is likely caused by the fact that `PanelContainer` is somehow one of only two classes (the second being `MarginContainer`) that use `c->get_desired_size()` instead of `c->get_bound_desired_size()`... for some reason. (Please fix both if that is indeed the root cause; otherwise, the same issue would happen with a `MarginContainer` replacing the `PanelContainer`. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5543610144/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5545278357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5545278357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5545278357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSoY7lQ","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T19:08:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T19:08:37Z","body":"Thanks makes sense. I’ll keep the `master` layout as the baseline and investigate the `PanelContainer`/`MarginContainer` and `get_desired_size()` path, while preserving the desired-size distribution introduced by #120640 I will verify it against the original MRP before making any further changes. \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5545278357/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5558684938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5558684938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5558684938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS1LNCg","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-06T10:42:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T10:44:13Z","body":"Here are two recordings showing the original MRP on the 4.8 dev build and with the current PR changes, so the layout behavior can be compared directly. I’m still not entirely sure if the current behavior is what the expected behavior should be. @StarryWorm, could you point me in the right direction is it right or there is some regression?\r\n## 4.8dev4\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a14ea974-d555-495b-a386-f69631a9037e\r\n\r\n## pr\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c998c13-105a-4ee1-ab0f-64f296d659c3\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5558684938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5646089406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5646089406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5646089406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUIh8vg","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T13:09:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T14:12:49Z","body":"Sorry for the delayed reply. \r\nIt recently came to light, through #123345, that PR #118309 introduced some unexpected regressions in layout. That PR was merged for 4.8.dev4. Checking for regressions against dev4 is thus most likely incorrect, as it itself contains regressions... (what a mess of a sentence). dev3 would be the correct target.\r\nI recommend putting this PR on hold until those regressions are fixed, since your layout comparisons are currently incorrect, through no fault of yours. It makes it very hard to see whether you are causing regressions or not, and what you are causing. \r\nI do plan on getting those regressions out of the way ASAP. I have not yet concretely determined whether it impacts this or not.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5646089406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5646588829","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5646588829","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5646588829,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUJAbnQ","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T14:44:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T14:44:05Z","body":"Ok so a little update on that, with a test scene. \r\nIt appears the desired size splitting system as introduced in #120640 was always fragile...\r\nThese tests are using `Label`s with trim characters (gives them a desired size too, but no layout loop). If I set the text of the second label first, then I get the result on top (undesired). If I set the text of the second label second, then I get the result on the bottom (desired) (this is equivalent to duplicating the node/opening the scene).\r\n<img width=\"633\" height=\"202\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb974929-33d0-4832-bef7-8c4466e7ace6\" />\r\nYour PR as it is makes it even worse, in that none of the Labels show up:\r\n<img width=\"732\" height=\"248\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e966724-02ae-4202-9b96-b2e4a9ad6b97\" />\r\nSo, whilst the root cause has changed, there is still an issue that I need to fix first, then we can take a look at layout loops. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5646588829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5646749494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123000#issuecomment-5646749494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123000","id":5646749494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUJKPNg","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T15:14:22Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T15:14:22Z","body":"Thanks for investigating this and for the clear explanation! Since the root cause involves those broader layout regressions, I agree it's best to wait. I've marked this PR as a draft for now.\r\n\r\nLet me know once the `desired_size` splitting fixes are merged, and we can take another look at the layout loops if they're still an issue. Thanks for all your help with testing!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5646749494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5648493410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull